{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Rhythm\u00a0</strong>is a high-energy, music-driven 2D side-scrolling space shooter, inspired by the intense action of games like\u00a0<i>R-Type</i> fused with the beautiful rhythmic style of games like\u00a0<i>Rez</i>. Every element moves to the beat - your ship\u2019s weapons fire in sync with the soundtrack, enemies spawn and attack in perfect time, and the vibrant, shifting levels react dynamically to the music. Even your <strong>supermoves</strong> don\u2019t just change the battlefield - they remix the soundtrack in real-time. With multiple game modes and a deep progression system, players can unlock powerful upgrades the more they play, fine-tuning their ship and strategies to match the rhythm of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/3aa71c20b9eaf5d0c2944806bad89a76.poster.avif?t=1757521282\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/3aa71c20b9eaf5d0c2944806bad89a76.webm?t=1757521282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/3aa71c20b9eaf5d0c2944806bad89a76.mp4?t=1757521282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From raw, underground <strong>drum &amp; bass</strong> and <strong>breakbeat</strong> to hard-hitting\u00a0<strong>electro</strong>, hypnotic\u00a0<strong>house</strong>, thunderous <strong>dubstep</strong>, bass-driven <strong>hip-hop</strong>, and laid-back <strong>lofi beats</strong>, the soundtrack is a world tour of cutting-edge sound. Featuring globe-spanning talent like DJ Magazine Official Top 100 DJ Naeleck, Azido 88, Lazy Habits, Sketi, Kraymon, Kouncilhouse, and Cryztal Grid. More artists to be announced soon...</p>